<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK CUTS SAVINGS RATES.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK CUTS SAVINGS RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank </p>
<p>said on Monday it would cut interest rates on its bank savings</p>
<p>certificates from December 1.</p>
<p>	     NEW RATE	  OLD RATE</p>
<p>	     2.25 percent    2.50 percent</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
